      "version": 2,
      "text": "email, password, passkeys, 2FA\nrole, verificationLevel\naccountType  PERSONAL | CREATOR | BUSINESS\nKYC / Stripe Identity\nStripe customer + Connect IDs\nisRootBanned, deletedAt, scheduledDeletionAt\n\nRelaciones de cuenta\nUserSettings, PlatformSubscription, Promotion\nMonetization, Transaction, unlocks\nLiveGift sender / receiver\nAppeal, DataExportRequest\nPushSubscription, DeviceSignal\n\nHandle público: email (privado)\nNo User.username.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "email, password, passkeys, 2FA\nrole, verificationLevel\naccountType  PERSONAL | CREATOR | BUSINESS\nKYC / Stripe Identity\nStripe customer + Connect IDs\nisRootBanned, deletedAt, scheduledDeletionAt\n\nRelaciones de cuenta\nUserSettings, PlatformSubscription, Promotion\nMonetization, Transaction, unlocks\nLiveGift sender / receiver\nAppeal, DataExportRequest\nPushSubscription, DeviceSignal\n\nHandle público: email (privado)\nNo User.username.",
