      "version": 1,
      "text": "Creador no es otra identidad.\nAccountType reversible: PERSONAL ↔ CREATOR (settings + syncUserTier).\nBUSINESS = plan Business. Studio si CREATOR | BUSINESS.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "id10-rect-34",
      "originalText": "Creador no es otra identidad.\nAccountType reversible: PERSONAL ↔ CREATOR (settings + syncUserTier).\nBUSINESS = plan Business. Studio si CREATOR | BUSINESS.",
